## Advanced Impact Analysis - render.vm
## Source: widgets/advImpact/src/render.vm. tools/build-widget.py inlines the shared snippets (shared/vm) at the
## BW_SHARED markers and shared/js/core.js + graph.js at the BW_INLINE_JS marker, checks the result with
## Velocity 1.4 and writes widgets/advImpact/dist/advImpact.zip.
## Velocity 1.4 dialect (guide 3.1.9): no map literals, one statement per line, no backslashes in strings.
## Method (spike tests/advImpact-v0.1.x, closed on 2512): start items of one document, then level by level one SQL query
## per direction on struct_workitem_linkedworkitems (frontier ids in IN lists of at most 500), each direction with its own
## visited set ("both" = a downstream and an upstream analysis, combined: a path never changes direction). Then the links of
## the selected roles between the reached items (Open API, getLinkedWorkItemsStructsDirect): the browser recomputes the
## levels from them for the toggles (roles, direction, levels).
## Terms: a link is stored on its source item and points to its target (verified on 2512). Downstream = items whose link
## points to the frontier (link sources); upstream = targets of the links of the frontier.
#set($bwVersion = "0.1.0")
